# Title: Clfs.SYS Loaded By Process Located In a Potential Suspicious Location
# ID: fb4e2211-6d08-426b-8e6f-0d4a161e3b1d
# Status: experimental
# Level: medium
# Author: X__Junior
# Date: 2025-01-20
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
# Description: Detects Clfs.sys being loaded by a process running from a potentially suspicious location. Clfs.sys is loaded as part of many CVEs exploits that targets Common Log File.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((ImageLoaded="*\\clfs.sys") AND (((process_path="*:\\Perflogs\\*" OR process_path="*:\\Users\\Public\\*" OR process_path="*\\Temporary Internet*" OR process_path="*\\Windows\\Temp\\*")) OR (((process_path="*:\\Users\\*" AND process_path="*\\Favorites\\*")) OR ((process_path="*:\\Users\\*" AND process_path="*\\Favourites\\*")) OR ((process_path="*:\\Users\\*" AND process_path="*\\Contacts\\*")) OR ((process_path="*:\\Users\\*" AND process_path="*\\Pictures\\*")))))
